{"id":"n27783-1-8","stage":2,"title":"최저 · 最低","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27783-1-8-1","ko":"내일 아침 최저 기온이 영하 이십 도래요.","zh":"明天早上的最低气温会降到零下二十度哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"최저","meaning":"最低","explanation":"최저：最低","readings":[{"term":"최저","audio":"/audio/e1b003304b44feb67dec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27783","senseId":"1","lemma":"최저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기온이","meaning":"气温","explanation":"기온：气温；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기온","audio":"/audio/48d003e07a2183c4aa32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38103","senseId":"1","lemma":"기온","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영하","meaning":"零下","explanation":"영하：零下","readings":[{"term":"영하","audio":"/audio/e05f9de9232ba50cf8c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71620","senseId":"1","lemma":"영하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이십","meaning":"二十","explanation":"이십：二十","readings":[{"term":"이십","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31648","senseId":"1","lemma":"이십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도래요.","meaning":"度","explanation":"도：度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"도","audio":"/audio/a3ec07cdd87ae1fabd09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47500","senseId":"1","lemma":"도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"e1b003304b44feb6","term":"최저","zh":"最低","audio":"/audio/e1b003304b44feb67dec.mp3","entryId":"27783","definition":"程度或水平最低。","pronunciation":["최ː저","췌ː저"]},{"id":"48d003e07a2183c4","term":"기온","zh":"气温","audio":"/audio/48d003e07a2183c4aa32.mp3","entryId":"38103","definition":"大气的温度。","pronunciation":["기온"]},{"id":"e05f9de9232ba50c","term":"영하","zh":"零下","audio":"/audio/e05f9de9232ba50cf8c2.mp3","entryId":"71620","definition":"零摄氏度以下的温度。","pronunciation":["영하"]},{"id":"b97d27f097a8b4a0","term":"이십","zh":"二十","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3","entryId":"31648","definition":"十的两倍的数目。","pronunciation":["이ː십"]},{"id":"a3ec07cdd87ae1fa","term":"도","zh":"度","audio":"/audio/a3ec07cdd87ae1fabd09.mp3","entryId":"47500","definition":"温度单位。","pronunciation":["도ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a9559cb5f186e09fffe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27783-1-8-2","ko":"옷을 따뜻하게 입고 나가야겠네요.","zh":"我得穿得暖和点再出门呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따뜻하게","meaning":"暖和","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가야겠네요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/feb94285c0cff44716ff.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27783","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我得穿得暖和点再出门呢。","明天早上的最低气温会降到零下二十度哦。","智秀最近在做什么呀？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["明天早上的最低气温会降到零下二十度哦。","智秀最近在做什么呀？","我得穿得暖和点再出门呢。"],"answer":2}]}
